      "title": "Manhunt after alleged axe attack in Victoria leaves three people with serious injuries",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/sep/06/manhunt-after-alleged-axe-attack-in-victoria-leaves-three-people-with-life-threatening-injuries-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>Police search for alleged attacker, in his 50s, after incident in Gippsland town of Tyers</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/sep/06/australia-news-live-albanese-labor-party-coaltion-liberal-party-nepal-floods-ntwnfb\">Follow our Australia news live blog for latest updates</a></p></li><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>Three people have been taken to hospital with life-threatening injuries after an alleged axe attack in Victoria, with police still searching for the suspect.</p><p>The alleged attacker, who is known to the victims, came to an address in the Gippsland town of Tyers at about 12.30pm on Saturday, according to a spokesperson for Victoria police.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/sep/06/manhunt-after-alleged-axe-attack-in-victoria-leaves-three-people-with-life-threatening-injuries-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
